pendence really holds.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing the choice under A-FDT, treating this as a prisoner's dilemma where the other agent runs the same model, so its move tracks mine, though not perfectly. Both staying quiet gives 2 years each, and I'm working out how that cooperative outcome follows from intervening on the shared decision function.\n\nI'm working through the threshold: if the other agent matches my choice with probability p, quiet pays 2p + 5(1−p) and letter pays 4p, so quiet wins once p exceeds 5/7, about 0.71. Since both copies run the same model on the same essay, I think that correlation is likely high enough, so I lean toward staying quiet, though I'm still checking whether the dependence really holds.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9329,"completion_tokens":646,"total_tokens":9975,"cost":0.025118,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.025118,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.018658,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00646},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":324,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}